OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'devastated' by nurse's
OL,4,A'needless' death after misdiagnosed
OL,5,Acondition
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a nurse who died just
OL,8,Fdays after her life-threatening heart
OL,9,Fcondition was misdiagnosed have told
OL,10,Fhow her "needless "death has left them
OL,11,F"devastated".
OL,13,FPaula Ivers attended Tameside General
OL,14,FHospital after complaining of chest
OL,15,Fpain but was sent home after being told
OL,16,Fit was acid reflux, her inquest heard.
OL,18,FThe 47-year-old children's nurse died
OL,19,Fthree days later at her home in Denton,
OL,20,FManchester, in March 2024. A coroner
OL,21,Fconcluded the death was contributed to
OL,22,Fby neglect.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
